{"ref":"BDB, עֲזַרְאֵל","hw":"עֲזַרְאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזַרְאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Ēl hath helped</em><strong>)</strong>;—Οζρειηλ, Εζριηλ, etc.:<br><strong>1.</strong>  warrior of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.7\">1 Ch 12:7</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.6\">6</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Levite musician <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.18\">1 Ch 25:18</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיאֵל</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.4\">4</a>), B Αζαρια, A Εζριηλ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Danite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.22\">1 Ch 27:22</a>, Αζαραηλ, Εζριηλ.<br><strong>4.</strong>  one with foreign wife <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:41\" href=\"/Ezra.10.41\">Ezr 10:41</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  priestly name: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.13\">Ne 11:13</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.36\">12:36</a>.","next":"BDB, עַזְרִיאֵל","prev":"BDB, עַזּוּר"}